### Gap Analysis (G-XX IDs)

| ID | Component | Current State | Target State | Severity |
|----|-----------|---------------|--------------|----------|
| **G-01** | `ProductGridSkeleton` | 3 columns, `gap-4`, beige placeholder | 4 columns, `gap-6`, `card-product-dark` structure | **High** |
| **G-02** | `FilterSidebarSkeleton` | Basic pulse blocks, no structure | Mirrors `FilterSidebar` exactly (sections, checkboxes, sliders) | **Medium** |
| **G-03** | `ShopHeader` | `type-section-hed` (3.2rem), minimal presence | Enhanced scale OR decorative header background | **High** |
| **G-04** | `FilterSidebar` | `bg-surface-elevated`, flat gray, complex height calc | Styled panel with section dividers, clean scroll behavior | **Medium** |
| **G-05** | `PriceRangeSlider` | Inline hex colors (`#D4AF37`, `#2E2E2D`), inline gradient styles | Design system tokens only (`bg-accent-500`, `bg-surface-elevated`) | **Medium** |
| **G-06** | `ProductGrid` | Functional but utilitarian | Consistent with homepage card aesthetics | **Medium** |
| **G-07** | `MobileControlsBar` | Presumably minimal (not audited) | Full-featured with filter drawer trigger | **Medium** |
| **G-08** | `MobileFilterDrawer` | Presumably basic | Full sidebar content in slide-out drawer | **Medium** |
| **G-09** | Page Layout | `h-[calc(100vh-...)]`, complex container math | Clean semantic layout with proper overflow | **Low** |
| **G-10** | Visual Polish | Zero decorative elements | Subtle fractal decorations or header texture (optional) | **Low** |

