### Scope Contract 6: ProductCard Polish — G-06
**Gap Coverage:** Cards functional but need homepage-level refinement

#### Target State
Product cards match homepage `FeaturedCard` aesthetic: cream image background (`bg-surface-productImage`), subtle shadows, gold border on hover, consistent type hierarchy.

#### DoD (Sequenced)
- [ ] **Pass 1 — Skeleton:** Debug border card structure
- [ ] **Pass 2 — Data:** Real product name, brand, price, image
- [ ] **Pass 3 — Layer 2 (Desktop Layout):**
  - Container: `.card-product-dark` (already implemented)
  - Image: `aspect-[4/3]`, `bg-surface-productImage`
  - Content: `p-4`, flex column
- [ ] **Pass 3 — Layer 3 (Desktop Surface):**
  - Brand: `type-caption` (top-left absolute)
  - Name: `type-card-title line-clamp-2`
  - Price: `type-price`
  - Button: `.btn-cart` (already implemented)
  - Image: `mix-blend-multiply` (if needed for white backgrounds)
- [ ] **Pass 3 — Layer 4 (Desktop Interaction):**
  - Card hover: `translateY(-2px)`, `boxShadow.cardHoverDark`, `border-color: brand-400`
  - Button hover: Standard `.btn-cart` hover
  - Image: Subtle scale on hover (optional)
- [ ] **Pass 3 — Layer 2-4 (Mobile):** Same behavior, touch-optimized

#### Delegation
```
/implement "Polish ProductCard to match homepage FeaturedCard: verify .card-product-dark hover states (lift + gold border), ensure bg-surface-productImage on image container, check type-card-title and type-price usage. Optional: add subtle image scale on hover."
```

