### Scope Contract 8: MobileFilterDrawer — G-08
**Gap Coverage:** Mobile filter experience presumably basic

#### Target State
Full-featured slide-out drawer containing all sidebar filters. Smooth animation, proper overlay, accessible focus trapping.

#### DoD (Sequenced)
