## Success Criteria (Sprint Lock)

- [ ] All 10 scope contracts complete with all DoDs checked
- [ ] Build passes: `npm run build` exits 0
- [ ] No visual jump between skeleton and loaded state
- [ ] Filter functionality intact (apply, clear, slider validation)
- [ ] Mobile drawer opens/closes smoothly
- [ ] Homepage unaffected (visual regression test)
- [ ] All design system tokens used correctly (no hardcoded hex values except in config)

